    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957370/extras/0c79f2a9ed52d494deb8aed7a1f3a2d5.avif?t=1716498614\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Strange, colorful and unusual; <strong><i>Escaping DandyLand</i></strong> is unlike any else preceding in the genre of frustration platformers. Can you traverse the central spire and escape? Can you discover the secret of its true nature? <br><br>Experience the challenge that is its platforming! See vistas of its strange land! Meet bizarre, peculiar and perhaps to some unhinged characters! Defy the lands strange and unsettling proprietor!<br><br>Equipped with magic boots, lunge through the air to achieve both high and long jumps, if you can master them! Use them to achieve \u201cCoyote Time\u201d to re-direct your movement mid-air!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957370/extras/64fbfebeb3fef0f215f915afec784f2e.avif?t=1716498614\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong><i>Escaping DandyLand</i></strong> is a game experience unique amongst its contemporaries in the \u201cUp-like\u201d genre with its surreal aesthetic. Can you reach the peak and discover what lies beyond?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features : </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Gameplay </i>: Yes !<br></li><li><i>Characters </i>: Bizarre and forgettable no matter how hard you try ! Unhinged dialogue with bouts of bawdy &amp; bodily humor.  <br></li><li><i>Music </i>: Its there somewhere !<br></li><li><i>Aesthetic </i>: A strange and surreal environment, where else can you find the alien and abstract along side jesters and fairies ?  <br></li><li><i>Story </i>: Obtuse !</li></ul><br><br><strong>Photosensitivity Warning. </strong>",
